Carry On for Sunrise

A port of Carry On 2.1.2.7 by Tschipp, Purplicious_Cow, cy4n.
Original source: https://github.com/Tschipp/CarryOn
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-only

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust, and the
content (items, blocks, textures, models, data) is carried over from the original jar. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-only); the licence text is in LICENSE.

LICENSE is the original's LICENSE_carryon (GNU LGPL v3); COPYING is the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on.

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko, on Sunrise's mod API, under the same licence.
